              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Objective\n\nCreate one clean, self-contained natural-language balance inquiry for query generation.\n\n## Input\n\nCurrent user message:\n<USER_MESSAGE>{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}</USER_MESSAGE>\n\nChat history:\n<CHAT_HISTORY>{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}}</CHAT_HISTORY>\n\nPrior intent details object, if provided:\n<PRIOR_INTENT_DETAILS>{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.state.private.lastUsedQuery.queryResponse.queries[0].intentDetails}}</PRIOR_INTENT_DETAILS>\n\nPrior query filter, if provided (used only for identifying treeVersionNames):\n<PRIOR_QUERY_FILTER>{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.state.private.lastUsedQuery.queryResponse.queries[0].filter}}</PRIOR_QUERY_FILTER>\n\n## Rules\n\nReturn the natural-language business question needed by query generation and whether the current message is a new base question or a follow-up.\n\n### Classify the Current User Message\n\nClassify the current user message as exactly one of these cases before constructing `nlQuestion`:\n- New complete balance request (`questionType=base_question`): The message can stand alone because it names an account reference as the primary balance subject and does not depend on prior scope.\n    - Account references may be account names, account codes, account combinations, account categories, or other user-facing account descriptions such as cash, revenue, expenses, assets, liabilities, or retained earnings.\n- Incomplete follow-up (`questionType=follow_up`): The message is incomplete, modifier-only, or depends on prior balance scope.\n    - Treat period-only, currency-only, breakdown-only, and other modifier-only messages as incomplete follow-ups. Do not send them by themselves.\n\n### Framing nlQuestion from a New Complete Balance Request\n\nWhen the current user message is a new complete balance request:\n\n- Use the current user message directly with only minimal cleanup needed to make it a valid natural-language balance inquiry.\n- Preserve the user's wording for account names, account combinations, COA member values, periods, currencies, measures, breakdowns, comparisons, and variance.\n- Do not add context from chat history or `Prior intent details`.\n\n### Framing nlQuestion from an Incomplete Follow-Up\n\nWhen the current user message is an incomplete follow-up:\n\n- Combine it with the most recent relevant user balance request in chat history and the prior intent details before producing `nlQuestion`.\n- Preserve the current user's requested modification, replacement, addition, or breakdown intent.\n- Use resolved values only when they are present in chat history or `Prior intent details`; otherwise keep the user's wording exactly and do not resolve, canonicalize, or infer values from model knowledge.\n- Treat `Prior intent details` as a flat object of prior resolved business scope. Its keys are business labels and its values are business-readable values.\n- When using `Prior intent details`, convert the relevant key-value pairs into natural language. Do not copy JSON syntax, braces, quotes, or key names that are not needed for the user request.\n- For resolved COA segment entries from `Prior intent details`:\n    - For valid COA segment entries, the key will be the `label`. The value will be in format `<coa segment value>-<coa segment description> <optional treeVersionName inside parenthesis>`.\n    - Strip off the treeVersionName if present (identify treeVersionNames using `PRIOR_QUERY_FILTER`). If the remaining value is empty, don't consider this as a resolved COA segment filter.\n    - Else, render them as `<label> <value-description>`, where `<label>` is the exact `Prior intent details` key and `<value-description>` is the corresponding value after removing treeVersionNames.\n- Preserve relative time phrases exactly, such as \"current period\", \"last quarter\", or \"same period last year\".\n- Include PTD, QTD, or YTD only when the user explicitly asks for it or it is clearly present in the relevant chat history being reused.\n- If the user includes breakdown, grouping, drill, expansion, contributor, leaf, or detail wording, preserve it in `nlQuestion`.\n- Do not add a COA segment label unless the user, relevant chat history, or prior intent details clearly provides it.\n\n### Common Framing Guardrails\n- Do not copy technical syntax into `nlQuestion`: no JSON keys, BQL, query objects, filter expressions, state keys, or internal field names.\n- Use `PRIOR_QUERY_FILTER` only to identify tree version names. Do not use it as a source for filters, values, scope, predicates, periods, currencies, ledgers, or any other query context.\n- Do not include ledger names or ledger scope from `Prior intent details` in `nlQuestion`. If `Prior intent details` contains a key such as `Ledger`, `Ledger Set`, or `Ledger Name`, ignore it while framing `nlQuestion`.\n- Preserve finance semantics that change balance meaning, including translated balance, total currency, converted all, per entered currency, entered currency, accounted balance, FX currency, non-ledger currency, reporting currency treatment, and period aggregation. Do not replace these phrases with generic currency or balance wording.\n- Do not invent missing account, period, currency, measure, COA labels, COA descriptions, or COA values.\n\n## Output\n\nReturn JSON only. Do not wrap in Markdown. Do not include comments or extra fields.\n\n```json\n{\"nlQuestion\":\"<clean natural-language balance inquiry>\",\"questionType\":\"<base_question|follow_up>\"}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Initial question examples\n\nExample 1:\n- Current user message: `Show period activity for cash in Mar-26`\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"Show period activity for cash in Mar-26.\",\"questionType\":\"base_question\"}\n    ```\n\nExample 2:\n- Current user message: `Show revenue for Apr-26 by company`\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"Show revenue for Apr-26 by company.\",\"questionType\":\"base_question\"}\n    ```\n\n### Multi-turn examples\n\nThese examples cover follow-up balance questions and complete new balance requests that arrive inside an existing chat.\n\nExample 3:\n- Current user message: `Now for Apr-26`\n- Chat history: `USER: Show period activity for cash in Mar-26`\n- Prior intent details:\n    ```json\n    {\"Account\":\"10000-Total Cash ( GM Accounts-V2 )\",\"Currency\":\"USD\",\"Accounting Period\":\"Mar-26\",\"Ledger\":\"JRP CAD Ledger\",\"Source\":\"Balances\"}\n    ```\n- Prior query filter contains: `...ABCAccount.treeVersionName = 'GM Accounts-V2'...`\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"Show period activity for Account 10000-Total Cash in Apr-26 in USD.\",\"questionType\":\"follow_up\"}\n    ```\n\nExample 4:\n- Current user message: `Use USD instead`\n- Chat history: `USER: Show ending balance for expenses in EUR for Q1-26`\n- Prior intent details:\n    ```json\n    {\"Account\":\"50000-Total Expenses ( GM Accounts-V2 )\",\"Company\":\"(All VF Companies-V2)\",\"Currency\":\"EUR\",\"Accounting Period\":\"Q1-26\",\"Ledger\":\"JAPAC SecLed\",\"Source\":\"Balances\"}\n    ```\n- Prior query filter contains: `...ABCAccount.treeVersionName = 'GM Accounts-V2'...ABCCompany.treeVersionName = 'All VF Companies-V2'...`\n- Context note: `GM Accounts-V2` is the Account tree version, so remove it from the Account value. `All VF Companies-V2` is only the Company tree version and no concrete Company member value remains, so do not include the Company label or tree version name in `nlQuestion`.\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"Show ending balance for Account 50000-Total Expenses in USD for Q1-26.\",\"questionType\":\"follow_up\"}\n    ```\n\nExample 5 (multi-turn):\n\nTurn 0:\n- Current user message: `total cash for current period`\n- Chat history: ``\n- Prior intent details: ``\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"total cash for current period\",\"questionType\":\"base_question\"}\n    ```\n\nTurn 1:\n- Current user message: `show only for Bingo co.`\n- Chat history: `USER: total cash for current period`\n- Prior intent details:\n    ```json\n    {\"Account\":\"10000-Total Cash ( GM Accounts-V2 )\",\"Currency\":\"USD\",\"Accounting Period\":\"Current Period\",\"Ledger\":\"JRP CAD Ledger\",\"Source\":\"Balances\"}\n    ```\n- Prior query filter contains: `...ABCAccount.treeVersionName = 'GM Accounts-V2'...`\n- Context note: The prior intent details contain service-resolved account `10000-Total Cash ( GM Accounts-V2 )`, currency `USD`, accounting period `Current Period`, and ledger `JRP CAD Ledger`. The prior query filter identifies `GM Accounts-V2` as a tree version name, so omit it from `nlQuestion`. Do not include the ledger. The current user added an unresolved phrase, so keep `Bingo co.` exactly as written.\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"Show balance for Account 10000-Total Cash for Bingo co. for current period in USD.\",\"questionType\":\"follow_up\"}\n    ```\n\nTurn 2:\n- Current user message: `add EUR`\n- Chat history: `USER: total cash for current period\\nUSER: show only for Bingo co.`\n- Prior intent details:\n    ```json\n    {\"Account\":\"10000-Total Cash ( GM Accounts-V2 )\",\"Company\":\"400-Bingo Co ( GUP_Entities-Current )\",\"Currency\":\"USD\",\"Accounting Period\":\"Current Period\",\"Ledger\":\"JAPAC SecLed\",\"Source\":\"Balances\"}\n    ```\n- Prior query filter contains: `...ABCAccount.treeVersionName = 'GM Accounts-V2'...ABCCompany.treeVersionName = 'GUP_Entities-Current'...`\n- Context note: The prior intent details contain service-resolved COA segment entries. Render them using exact intent detail keys, and remove only the tree version name identified by the prior query filter: `Account 10000-Total Cash` and `Company 400-Bingo Co`.\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"Show balance for Account 10000-Total Cash, Company 400-Bingo Co for current period in USD and EUR.\",\"questionType\":\"follow_up\"}\n    ```\n\nExample 6:\n- Current user message: `Show cash balance for May-26`\n- Chat history: `USER: Show cost of goods sold for Company 400 - Bingo Co in Apr-26`\n- Prior intent details:\n    ```json\n    {\"Company\":\"400-Bingo Co ( GUP_Entities-Current )\",\"Account\":\"52125-Total Cost of Goods Sold- Wine ( GM Accounts-V2 )\",\"Currency\":\"USD\",\"Accounting Period\":\"Apr-26\",\"Ledger\":\"JRP CAD Ledger\",\"Source\":\"Balances\"}\n    ```\n- Prior query filter contains: `...ABCAccount.treeVersionName = 'GM Accounts-V2'...ABCCompany.treeVersionName = 'GUP_Entities-Current'...`\n- Context note: The current message is a complete new balance request for cash in May-26, so prior Company and COGS scope must not be merged.\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"Show cash balance for May-26.\",\"questionType\":\"base_question\"}\n    ```\n\nExample 7 (translated balance follow-up):\n\nTurn 0:\n- Current user message: `show translated balance of revenue account in CAD for current period`\n- Chat history: ``\n- Prior intent details: ``\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"show translated balance of revenue account in CAD for current period\",\"questionType\":\"base_question\"}\n    ```\n\nTurn 1:\n- Current user message: `compare with previous period`\n- Chat history: `USER: show translated balance of revenue account in CAD for current period`\n- Prior intent details:\n    ```json\n    {\"Account\":\"40000-Total Revenue ( GM Accounts-V2 )\",\"Currency\":\"CAD\",\"Accounting Period\":\"Current Period\",\"Ledger\":\"JAPAC SecLed\",\"Source\":\"Balances\"}\n    ```\n- Prior query filter contains: `...ABCAccount.treeVersionName = 'GM Accounts-V2'...`\n- Context note: The prior request used the finance semantic phrase `translated balance`. Carry it forward and add the current comparison request. The prior query filter identifies `GM Accounts-V2` as a tree version name, so omit it from `nlQuestion`.\n- Output:\n    ```json\n    {\"nlQuestion\":\"Compare translated balance of Account 40000-Total Revenue in CAD for current period vs previous period.\",\"questionType\":\"follow_up\"}\n    ```"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"nlQuestion\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 1,\n      \"maxLength\": 2000\n    },\n    \"questionType\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"base_question\",\n        \"follow_up\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"nlQuestion\",\n    \"questionType\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
